The '''Gun Workbench''' is one of the eleven workbench types in ''[[Human Host]]''.

Assembles firearms and firearm ammunition.

Internal enum value: <code>WorkbenchType.GunWorkbench</code> (assembly <code>UI</code>). Prefab: <code>WB_Gunsmith</code>.

